Third-party datasets

This license covers the code and documentation in this repository. It does not
cover the benchmark datasets the harness downloads (HumanEval+, MBPP+,
LiveCodeBench, BIRD Mini-Dev). They are not redistributed here and remain under
their owners' licenses and terms; see the sources listed in
configs/datasets.yaml. Short problem excerpts quoted in reports/ are included
for commentary and remain the property of their owners.
